  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/projects/minecraft/mods/more-barrel-variants/title_mr.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Текстуры от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hunnycakehorse</a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/requires/quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img width=\"52\"><img width=\"26\"><img width=\"13\"><img width=\"8\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Stick-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\"> pnku:</sup> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a> <img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/dividers/horizontal/pnku_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>Больше вариантов бочек</h1>\n<p>Наполните свои постройки красочными хранилищами: теперь у каждого типа древесины есть своя бочка.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/q1y1g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Добавляет 11 новых <em>бочек</em> в Minecraft.</h2>\n<h4>Эти бочки также можно скрафтить с помощью <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-woodcutter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's Woodcutter</a>¹.</h4>\n<p>¹: В версиях 1.11.3 и выше.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Совместимо с заменой блоков из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+:</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/9r8b9.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\nЕсли взглянуть на домик рыбака в деревне саванны, можно заметить, что вместо <em>еловых бочек</em>, <em>дубовых факелов</em> и обычного <em>компостера</em> игра теперь генерирует деревню с <em><strong>акациевыми бочками</strong></em>, <em><strong>акациевыми факелами</strong></em> (из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Torch Variants</a>) и <em><strong>акациевым компостером</strong></em> (из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-composter-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Composter Variants</a>).</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
